# Agent token scope and exploration

Active delivery stack works; keep token use bounded.

## Headroom (proxy + RTK + compress/retrieve)

- Prefer **Headroom** for log/diff compression before context hits the model.
- **GitNexus** for call-chain / dependency queries via MCP after `gitnexus analyze` (primary structural search for this repo).
- Windows: `pip install "headroom-ai[mcp,proxy]==0.20.15"` until win_amd64 wheels ship for 0.21+; see `docs/qa-cursor-workflow.md`.
- Setup: `headroom proxy --port 8787` + point base URL at `http://127.0.0.1:8787/v1`, or use Headroom MCP (`headroom mcp serve` in Cursor).

## Graphify (optional — cross-doc knowledge graph)

- For architecture questions, prefer **GitNexus MCP** (indexed via `gitnexus analyze`) or **graphify** for broader corpus search.
- Index once: `/graphify .` (or `graphify update .` after changes). Output lives in `graphify-out/` (gitignored).
- Query: `/graphify query "<question>" --budget 1500` or `graphify path "HelperA" "PageObjectB"`.
- Read only the **matched nodes + cited `source_file` lines** — never paste full `tests/**/*.spec.ts` or `pageObjects/**` files unless editing that file.

## Scoped paths (stay in layer boundaries)

| Task | Allowed paths | Rule file |
|------|---------------|-----------|
| Specs | `tests/**/*.spec.ts` | `spec-authoring` |
| UI locators / actions | `pageObjects/**` | `page-objects-and-helpers`, `locator-verification` |
| Excel / Python bridge | `utils/**`, `testData/**` | `excel-and-utils`, `excel-generation-from-tests` |
| Cross-cutting | `Helpers/**` only when a helper flow is explicitly in scope | `page-objects-and-helpers` |

Do not pull full-repo context. Scope prompts to one flow, one template, or one helper chain.

## Skill-first workflows (prefer over “fix everything”)

Use project skills when the task matches:

- `add-field-validation-case` — Excel field validation
- `add-conditional-validation-case` — Oman PINT-OM if-then conditionals (no UAE rules)
- `add-formula-validation-case` — formula / calculated totals
- `add-submit-test-case` — submit / delivery
- `add-ui-invoice-test` — Create Invoice UI
- `generate-excel-from-testcase` — pick pipeline and generate `.xlsx` from a testcase
- `author-excel-testcase-data` — camelCase vs Excel-header row/payload authoring
- `playwright-locator-expert` — stable locators for `pageObjects/**`
- `debug-failing-uae-test` — flakes, timeouts, upload stuck

Open prompts like “refactor the framework” or “fix all failing tests” are out of scope unless the user names a single file or test.
